\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {16}{\ignorespaces From a model request to an inspectable result. The harness supplies task context and checks permission. The owning operation checks the current basis and records the change. The human and parent task can inspect the same outcome, judge its interpretation and request a revision. The loop keeps the proposal, action and acceptance connected.}}{33}{figure.caption.16}\protected@file@percent }
