\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {17}{\ignorespaces The recorded Eigen campaign on the SuperARC reconstruction task. (a) Fractions $\rho _k$ in each correct-answer category for $N=100$ twelve-term binary targets. All arms recorded correct outcomes through their distinct checking routes. (b) Loop-minus-execute/fix score difference $\Delta \phi $. Stripping commentary with categories fixed removes the positive separation. Bars are the archived 95\% paired-bootstrap intervals at resample size 100, seed 20260804 and 100 resamples. No interval was reported for the re-binned point. Formula-text scoring, program correctness and unequal search protocols prevent a causal recursion claim.}}{35}{figure.caption.17}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:dd-superarc-controls}{{17}{35}{The recorded Eigen campaign on the SuperARC reconstruction task. (a) Fractions $\rho _k$ in each correct-answer category for $N=100$ twelve-term binary targets. All arms recorded correct outcomes through their distinct checking routes. (b) Loop-minus-execute/fix score difference $\Delta \phi $. Stripping commentary with categories fixed removes the positive separation. Bars are the archived 95\% paired-bootstrap intervals at resample size 100, seed 20260804 and 100 resamples. No interval was reported for the re-binned point. Formula-text scoring, program correctness and unequal search protocols prevent a causal recursion claim}{figure.caption.17}{}}
